[@5]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
You collect money and send it to us due to the fact that we  don't have any gysers.

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Preparation</h2> 
<i>"Preparing for upcoming events is always a good idea, but it has its drawbacks.."<br>
--Rain Wizard</i>
<p>Running low on resources, you make you way to a nearby storm field.  The field is guarded by two guards and a narrow passage way.  You and you allies decide to sqeeze you through first.  The guards are now aware of this and it is time for battle! 
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>
After defeating the guards, you make your way through the storm field gathering what you need.
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b11

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
Im under attack!

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Rain Wizard,  you were overwhelmed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Wind Knight,  you were overwhelmed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have died in battle and what happened to your allies is irrelevant, but they probally died.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
